          "component_type": "gpu",
          "metric_value": "200",
          "unit": "GPUs",
          "source_quote": "“Artificial Intelligence will define the next era of economic growth, industrial competitiveness, and national innovation. As Master Group, we are building the infrastructure Pakistan needed someone to build. We must build the digital infrastructure necessary to participate in this transformation—not simply consume it. The launch of Pakistan’s first Cisco AI GPU Cluster powered by NVIDIA H200 GPUs is an important milestone towards creating sovereign AI capability and empowering our innovators, enterprises, and public sector with world-class computing resources.” – Shahzad Malik, Managing Director, Master Group of Industries.",
